        "title": "4. `src/fetch/engine.py` — **partially tested**",
        "content": "\nUntested: `_normalize_url` (laws-lois rewrite, non-matching URL), cache hit path, stale cache fallback, `FetchError` on total failure, `fetch_batch`, `_get_domain` (malformed URLs), rate-limit delay logic.\n\n```python\n",
