        "content": "\nUntested: `list_queries`, `save_agent_response`/`get_agent_responses`, `save_orchestrator_response`/`get_orchestrator_response`, `save_feedback`/`get_feedback_for_query`/`export_feedback`, cache operations (`get_cached`/`get_stale`/`set_cached`/`clear_expired`), `get_query` returning `None` for missing ID.\n\n```python\n",
